            <ArticleTitle>Bilateral cystic lymphangioma of the adrenal gland.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>424-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a 22-year-old woman with a large, bilateral lymphangiomatous cyst originating from the adrenal glands. Since she was having persistent pain and the diagnosis was uncertain, we did surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
